A LOT OF RESEARCH INTO THE

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.226 line:78%
TOPIC.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.327 line:78%
A LOT OF THINGS HE DIDN'T SEEM

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:30.096 line:78%
TO KNOW, FOR EXAMPLE, IN

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:32.065 line:78%
FEBRUARY 1 OF THE OLDEST MEDICAL

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:34.334 line:78%
JOURNALS THE WORLD SUMMARIZED

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.801 line:78%
RESEARCHERS FINDINGS ON PUBERTY

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.436 line:78%
BLOCKERS.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:39.372 line:78%
