00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:41.674 line:78%
THE PUBERTY USED TO TREAT

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.742 line:78%
CHILDREN 12 TO 15 THAT HAVE

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:44.611 line:78%
GENDER DYSPHORIA HAD NO

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.412 line:78%
SIGNIFICANT EFFECT ON THEIR

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:49.115 line:78%
PSYCHOLOGICAL FUNCTION, THOUGHTS

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:51.951 line:78%
OF SELF HARM OR BODY IMAGE.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:53.353 line:78%
THE CHILDREN EXPERIENCE REDUCED

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.087 line:78%
GROWTH IN HEIGHT AND BONE

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.755 line:78%
STRENGTH.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:58.625 line:78%
THERE IS FACT, KEEP IN MIND.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:01:00.126 line:78%
THE GOVERNMENT SAID CHILDREN

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:02.595 line:78%
NEEDED THESE DRUGS IN ORDER TO

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:03.797 line:78%
NOT BECOME CLINICALLY DEPRESSED.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.464 line:78%
THIS SUGGESTS THEY DON'T HELP,

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:06.900 line:78%
ONLY HURT THEIR BODIES.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:09.302 line:78%
THERE OTHER STUDIES, ONE

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.374 line:78%
CONDUCTED BY THEY HAVE STARK

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:15.809 line:78%
CLINIC, THAT IT HAS INCREASED

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.743 line:78%
INCIDENCES OF SELF HARM AND

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.710 line:78%
SUICIDAL IDEATION.

