SUPPORTING THE IDEA THAT THE

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:36.162 line:78%
PUBERTY BLOCKERS SHOULD NOT BE

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:38.164 line:78%
GIVEN TO CHILDREN.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.799 line:78%
THOSE DRUGS MAY MAKE IT WORSE.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.968 line:78%
AT THE MOST THOROUGH

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:43.470 line:78%
PEER-REVIEWED STUDY ON THE TOPIC

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.237 line:78%
WAS CONDUCTED IN SWEDEN.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:47.240 line:78%
RESEARCHERS FOLLOW THE OUTCOMES

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:49.175 line:78%
